cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CIEO — Construction Inspection Evidence Ontology"
message: "If you use CIEO, please cite both the software and the accompanying publication."
type: software
abstract: >-
  An ontology and reference implementation for evidence-aware construction inspection.
  CIEO represents regulatory inspection requirements, the construction process they are
  scoped to, the BIM and site geometry they target, the visual observations offered as
  evidence, and the observation conditions under which that evidence was gathered, so that
  a compliance decision can be withheld when the evidence was never capable of settling it.
  Requirements are jurisdiction-neutral; the legal grounding is supplied by pluggable
  jurisdiction profiles.
authors:
